### Test Notification Endpoints (Direct API Routes)
### Note: Replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN with a valid JWT token from login

# Test 1: Get notifications (Direct route - NEW!)
GET http://localhost:3013/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

###

# Test 2: Get notifications (Original social route)  
GET http://localhost:3013/api/v1/SER/notifications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

